{"type":"proposition","type_name":"Proposition","number":"32.6.1","title":"BLUP as a posterior mean, REML as a marginal posterior","title_html":"BLUP as a posterior mean, REML as a marginal posterior","html":"<p>Consider <span class=\"citation\" data-cites=\"eq-mix-hierarchy\">@eq-mix-hierarchy</span> with <span class=\"math inline\"><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"CHTML\" style=\"font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{G}\"><mjx-math class=\" MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-TeXAtom texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-b\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D406 TEX-B\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-TeXAtom></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">G</mi></mrow></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></span> and <span class=\"math inline\"><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"CHTML\" style=\"font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{R}\"><mjx-math class=\" MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-TeXAtom texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-b\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D411 TEX-B\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-TeXAtom></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">R</mi></mrow></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></span> positive definite and <span class=\"math inline\"><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"CHTML\" style=\"font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{rank}(\\mathbf{X})=p\"><mjx-math class=\" MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c72\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c61\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c6E\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c6B\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c28\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-TeXAtom texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-b\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D417 TEX-B\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-TeXAtom><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c29\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c3D\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D45D TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>rank</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">X</mi></mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>p</mi></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></span>.</p>\n<div class=\"enumerate\" data-options=\"label=(\\alph*)\">\n<ol type=\"1\">\n<li><p><em>(BLUP is a posterior mean.)</em> Fix <span class=\"math inline\"><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"CHTML\" style=\"font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;\" data-tex=\"\\boldsymbol{\\uptheta}\"><mjx-math class=\" MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-b\"><mjx-utext style=\"font-size: 88.4%; padding: 0.848em 0 0.226em 0;\" variant=\"bold\">𝛉</mjx-utext></mjx-mi></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">θ</mi></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></span> and take the\nimproper flat prior <span class=\"math inline\"><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"CHTML\" style=\"font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;\" data-tex=\"\\pi(\\boldsymbol{\\upbeta})\\propto1\"><mjx-math class=\" MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D70B TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c28\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-b\"><mjx-utext style=\"font-size: 88.4%; padding: 0.848em 0 0.226em 0;\" variant=\"bold\">𝛃</mjx-utext></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c29\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c221D\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c31\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>π</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">β</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>∝</mo><mn>1</mn></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></span>. Then the joint\nposterior of <span class=\"math inline\"><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"CHTML\" style=\"font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;\" data-tex=\"(\\boldsymbol{\\upbeta},\\mathbf{u})\"><mjx-math class=\" MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c28\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-b\"><mjx-utext style=\"font-size: 88.4%; padding: 0.848em 0 0.226em 0;\" variant=\"bold\">𝛃</mjx-utext></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2C\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-TeXAtom space=\"2\" texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-b\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D42E TEX-B\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-TeXAtom><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c29\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">β</mi><mo>,</mo><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">u</mi></mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></span> is <span class=\"math display\"><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"CHTML\" style=\"font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;\" display=\"true\" data-tex=\"\n\\begin{pmatrix}\\boldsymbol{\\upbeta}\\\\\\mathbf{u}\\end{pmatrix}\\Bigm|\\mathbf{y}\n\\sim\\mathrm{N}_{p+q}\\Bigl(\n\\begin{pmatrix}\\hat{\\boldsymbol{\\upbeta}}\\\\\\hat{\\mathbf{u}}\\end{pmatrix},\\ \\mathbf{C}^{-1}\\Bigr),\n\"><mjx-math display=\"true\" style=\"margin-left: 0; margin-right: 0;\" class=\" MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mrow><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-s3\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c28 TEX-S3\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mtable style=\"min-width: 0.639em;\"><mjx-tabl